#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using this module, you can choose your screen saver, determine how much time "
"must pass before the screen saver is activated, and add or remove password "
"protection to your screen saver."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting the time, priority and passwords for screen savers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the top is a check box to have the screen saver <guilabel>Start "
"automatically after</guilabel>, and a spin box which determines the period "
"of inactivity before the screen saver should be started. You can enter any "
"positive number of minutes in this box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below that is a check box labeled <guilabel>Require password after</"
"guilabel>. If it is checked, when you click a key or click a mouse button to "
"end the screen saver after the time in the spinbox and return to your work, "
"you must enter a password. The password used is the same password you used "
"to login to your machine. If there is no mark in the check box, no password "
"is required to return to your desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choosing the screen saver, and configuring its options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <guilabel>Simple locker</guilabel> option for a basic unlock dialog "
"that prompts for a password."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you would like to have some interactive widgets like notes or a player on "
"the locked screen saver, select <guilabel>Desktop Widgets</guilabel> and "
"click the <guibutton>Configure...</guibutton> button to select your favorite "
"widgets."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable the selection of all available screen savers select the "
"<guilabel>Screen saver</guilabel> option. You can select a screen saver by "
"simply clicking on its name. Once you have selected a screen saver, you will "
"see a small preview on the monitor on the right."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The preview monitor will often show the screen saver larger than it is when "
"the screen saver is activated. This is done on purpose, since many of the "
"details of the screen savers would be unintelligible if actually scaled down "
"to such a small size."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each screen saver has a different set of setup options. By clicking on "
"<guilabel>Setup...</guilabel>, a dialog box will appear with all available "
"options. As you adjust the options, the preview box in the dialog box will "
"show you what effect you will achieve with the current settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are done setting up your screen saver, click <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> will erase any changes you made in "
"this dialog box, and return you to the screen saver module."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For most screen savers a description, Copyright and Author information is "
"shown directly in the dialog, for others you need to click the "
"<guibutton>About</guibutton> button to read this information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you think you have all the options set the way you want, simply click "
"on <guibutton>Test</guibutton> to immediately start the screen saver "
"<emphasis>exactly</emphasis> as it will appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using a non-&kde; screen saver"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; does not prevent another screen saver from working. To use a different "
"screen saver, such as <application>xscreensaver</application>, simply "
"disable the &kde; Screen Saver, and set up your other screen saver program "
"normally."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Settings: Grace period"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a five second grace period after the screen saver begins before a "
"password is required even if <guilabel>Require password</guilabel> is "
"checked."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Locking the desktop manually, by clicking the lock icon in the &kde; panel, "
"causes the password protection to engage immediately with no grace period."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To alter the grace period setting, you need to manually edit the "
"configuration file. To do so:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <command>cd <filename>~/.kde/share/config</filename> </"
"command>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now, using a text editor (the example uses &kate;, the &kde; text editor), "
"load the <filename>kscreensaverrc</filename>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>$</prompt> <command>kate <filename>kscreensaverrc</filename> </"
"command>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Search through the file for an entry entitled <emphasis>LockGrace</emphasis>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "If the entry exists, you can edit the value of the entry."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "LockGrace=3000"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The value of the entity represents the duration of the grace period in "
"milliseconds. An entry of 3000, would change the grace period to 3 seconds. "
"You can set the value of the entry to any number between zero (no grace "
"period) and 600000 (10 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the entry does not exist, simply add the entry to the end of the section."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Any changes to the configuration entry take effect immediately."
msgstr ""
